cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "epibyhand: Worked Derivations for Classical Epidemiological Measures"
version: 0.1.0
abstract: >-
  Computes classical epidemiological measures and returns the complete worked
  derivation alongside the result: every intermediate quantity, the formula,
  and the formula with the observed numbers substituted in. Intended for
  teaching, for checking hand calculations, and for generating worked
  solutions in course materials.
authors:
  - family-names: Subedi
    given-names: Raj
    email: rajsubediresearch@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/rajsubediresearch/epibyhand"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - R
  - epidemiology
  - biostatistics
  - teaching
  - statistics-education
